% C4-SEARCH: SEARCH_STRING (RDEF:1216) FOR "XYZ" IN A RUN OF DOTS.  A SOURCE
% SHORTER THAN FFFF IS ONE MATCHC.  A LONGER ONE IS SEARCHED IN GROUPS OF
% FFFF BYTES, EACH STARTING PATLEN-1 BYTES BEFORE THE LAST ONE ENDED, SO
% THAT EVERY PLACE THE PATTERN COULD START IS TRIED ONCE (DEFECT 46: THE
% SHIPPED GROUPS MISSED THE LAST BYTES, AND COULD START BEFORE THE SOURCE).
% THE CASES PUT THE PATTERN AT THE ENDS OF THE SOURCE, ACROSS THE GROUP
% BOUNDARIES, AND JUST BEFORE THE SOURCE.  SHOW PRINTS THE SUCCESS FLAG,
% THE REST OF THE SOURCE (LENGTH, OFFSET FROM SRC), THE PATTERN (LENGTH,
% OFFSET FROM ITS START) AND THE 99 BELOW.  THE SCRATCH AREA IS FREE CODE
% SPACE PAST CODE_PNTR.
DECIMAL
0 'TS VARIABLE 0 'TA VARIABLE 0 'TN VARIABLE 0 'TP VARIABLE
'SRC : TS @ ;
'TDOTS : SRC TA ! ( 46 TA @ I + B! ) ;
'TPUT : SRC + DUP 88 SWAP B! 1+ DUP 89 SWAP B! 1+ 90 SWAP B! ;
'TFIND : TN ! 99 "XYZ" COUNT OVER TP ! SRC TN @ SEARCH_STRING ;
'TFIND1 : TN ! 99 "Z" COUNT OVER TP ! SRC TN @ SEARCH_STRING ;
'SHOW : = = SRC - = = TP @ - = = CR ;
CODE_PNTR @ 4096 + TS !
"PAT " MSG "XYZ" COUNT = DROP CR
"S100-50   " MSG 100 TDOTS 50 TPUT 100 TFIND SHOW
"S100-NONE " MSG 100 TDOTS 100 TFIND SHOW
"S65534-END " MSG 65540 TDOTS 65531 TPUT 65534 TFIND SHOW
"S65535-END " MSG 65540 TDOTS 65532 TPUT 65535 TFIND SHOW
"S65535-MID " MSG 65540 TDOTS 30000 TPUT 65535 TFIND SHOW
"S65535-0   " MSG 65540 TDOTS 0 TPUT 65535 TFIND SHOW
"S65536-END " MSG 65540 TDOTS 65533 TPUT 65536 TFIND SHOW
"S65536-E1  " MSG 65540 TDOTS 65532 TPUT 65536 TFIND SHOW
"S65536-E3  " MSG 65540 TDOTS 65530 TPUT 65536 TFIND SHOW
"S65536-0   " MSG 65540 TDOTS 0 TPUT 65536 TFIND SHOW
"S65536-1   " MSG 65540 TDOTS 1 TPUT 65536 TFIND SHOW
"S65536-2   " MSG 65540 TDOTS 2 TPUT 65536 TFIND SHOW
"S65536-NO  " MSG 65540 TDOTS 65536 TFIND SHOW
"S200000-END " MSG 200010 TDOTS 199997 TPUT 200000 TFIND SHOW
"S200000-B  " MSG 200010 TDOTS 131065 TPUT 200000 TFIND SHOW
"S200000-Z  " MSG 200010 TDOTS 199997 TPUT 200000 TFIND1 SHOW
% 131066 IS TWICE FFFD: THE SHIPPED SEARCH BEGAN 2 BYTES BEFORE SRC
"S131066-PRE " MSG 131070 TDOTS -2 TPUT 131066 TFIND SHOW
"S131066-END " MSG 131070 TDOTS 131063 TPUT 131066 TFIND SHOW
"S131068-END " MSG 131070 TDOTS 131065 TPUT 131068 TFIND SHOW
"STACK " MSG 77 = CR
